OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England footballer Raheem
OL,4,ASterling to be sentenced for dangerous
OL,5,Adriving
OL,6,
OL,7,FRaheem Sterling is due to be sentenced
OL,8,Fafter pleading guilty to dangerous
OL,9,Fdriving earlier this year
OL,11,FThe former England footballer, 31, was
OL,12,Farrested after crashing a Lamborghini
OL,13,Fnear the M3 in Hampshire on the morning
OL,14,Fof 28 May - police body-worn footage
OL,15,Fcaptured the moment of his arrest
OL,17,FBasingstoke Magistrates' Court heard he
OL,18,Fstrayed into the central reservation of
OL,19,Fthe motorway, before exiting and
OL,20,Fcrashing into "roadside infrastructure"
OL,21,Fin a layby
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
