OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England footballer Raheem
OL,4,ASterling to be sentenced for dangerous
OL,5,Adriving
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne eyewitness told police she saw
OL,8,F"absolutely horrendous driving" as the
OL,9,Fcar swerved in and out of lanes
OL,11,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving the
OL,12,Fcar dangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,13,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,14,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,15,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation and
OL,16,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,17,Fanalysis
OL,19,FThe footballer has 82 England caps, the
OL,20,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,21,FCup in Qatar
